      "details": "Create new class org.jsoup.parser.ParserConfigApi which encapsulates the deprecated configuration accessors and mutators previously on Parser. The new class is located in the same package and holds a reference to a Parser instance; methods delegate to parser.config(). Methods moved are all the deprecated configuration wrappers (isTrackErrors, setTrackErrors, getErrors, isTrackPosition, setTrackPosition, settings(ParseSettings), settings(), setMaxDepth, getMaxDepth, tagSet(TagSet), tagSet()). All moved methods keep their original signatures and deprecation annotations but are now members of ParserConfigApi. This extraction groups the configuration API into a single responsibility: providing the legacy configuration facade.",
